WEBVTT

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:02.574
via our receptors
in our gastrointestinal tract.

00:13:03.137 --> 00:13:04.537
The future will show.

00:13:05.978 --> 00:13:08.803
Our conscious experience of food

00:13:08.827 --> 00:13:13.791
is just the tip of the iceberg
of our total sensation of food.

00:13:13.815 --> 00:13:16.122
And by studying this total sensation,

00:13:16.146 --> 00:13:19.022
conscious and subconscious alike,

00:13:19.046 --> 00:13:23.555
I truly believe that we can make
tastier and healthier foods for all.

00:13:23.579 --> 00:13:24.730
Thank you.

00:13:24.754 --> 00:13:29.920
(Applause)